+# Local alpha.4 adapter
+
+This derivative is `0.1.23+alpha4.2`, built for DSH `0.2.1-alpha.4` only. The host APIs changed, so older upstream-supported hosts are historical provenance, not supported targets of this adapter. Install the local payload path; the upstream npm installation commands below install the original release. Runtime qualification and remaining limits are in the host installation receipt.
+
+Captain stages can be reserved with `create_task(assignee="captain")` before their dependencies finish. Claim the ready reservation with `claim_task`; one captain attempt may run at a time. An interrupted attempt remains captain-owned pending and does not enter the member pool. This is a local source research change with separately recorded validation.
+
+---
+
